<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Telmex to report Q3 on Oct 24.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Telmex to report Q3 on Oct 24.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican telephone giant Telefonos de Mexico S.A. will report third quarter earnings on Thursday, October 24 at 5:30 p.m./2330 GMT, company officials said.</p>
<p>A company spokesman told Reuters that a conference call with analysts will also be held on Friday, October 25 at 9:00 a.m. (1400 GMT), sponsored by Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p>-- David Luhnow, Mexico City newsroom +525 782-9565</p>
</text>
